        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Further, similar to (Nagel et al., 2020; Li et al., 2021; Frantar et al., 2022), we assume that the quantization grid for  $ \\widehat{W} $ is fixed before the process, and that individual weights can move freely as in (Hubara et al., 2021; Frantar et al., 2022).",
